    {
      "exercise": "855",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "在实数范围内，用配方法把方程化成一个二项式的平方等于常数。\na) $(x-1)^2=36$，所以 $x=1\\pm6$，根为 $-5$、$7$。\nb) $(x+4)^2=36$，所以 $x=-4\\pm6$，根为 $-10$、$2$。\nc) $(y+8)^2=0$，所以只有一个根 $y=-8$。\nd) $(x+7)^2=-1$。实数的平方不能为负数，因此没有实根。\ne) $\\left(y-\\frac{7}{2}\\right)^2=\\frac{81}{4}$，所以 $y=\\frac{7}{2}\\pm\\frac{9}{2}$，根为 $-1$、$8$。\nf) $\\left(x+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2=\\frac{9}{4}$，所以 $x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\pm\\frac{3}{2}$，根为 $-2$、$1$。",
      "parts": [],
      "notes": "Six completing-square tasks, retaining the source's real-number and empty-root-set setting."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "856",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "先把方程的每一项除以首项系数，再配方。\na) $x^2-\\frac{9}{2}x+5=0$，即 $\\left(x-\\frac{9}{4}\\right)^2=\\frac{1}{16}$。因此 $x=\\frac{9}{4}\\pm\\frac{1}{4}$，根为 $2$、$\\frac{5}{2}$。\nb) $x^2+\\frac{3}{5}x-\\frac{8}{5}=0$，即 $\\left(x+\\frac{3}{10}\\right)^2=\\frac{169}{100}$。因此 $x=-\\frac{3}{10}\\pm\\frac{13}{10}$，根为 $-\\frac{8}{5}$、$1$。",
      "parts": [],
      "notes": "Two equations. Nonzero source leading coefficients permit monic reduction; roots can be substituted into the original equations."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "857",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "把两个数记为 $u$、$v$。已知 $u+v=\\sqrt{10}$、$u-v=\\sqrt{6}$。\n由平方差关系，\n$4uv=(u+v)^2-(u-v)^2=10-6=4$。\n所以 $uv=1$，即这两个数的积等于 1。即使交换两个数，乘积仍不变。",
      "parts": [],
      "notes": "One proof task. Introduced u,v name the original two numbers and do not change their given sum or difference."
    }
  ]
